High-performance spell checker

Usage: matchum <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check   Check files for spelling errors
  lint    Check files (strict mode, exits 1 on errors)
  trace   Trace a word through dictionaries
  init    Initialize a matchum.toml config file
  review  Interactively review spelling issues
  add     Add words to the project dictionary
  dict    Manage dictionary packages
  cspell  cspell-compatible command interface
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
